// 4. Upload the final chunk with `X-Egnyte-Last-Chunk: true` and `X-Sha512-Checksum` set to the composite whole-file checksum `{version}-{numChunks}-{chunkSize}-{SHA512 of the concatenated hex-encoded chunk checksums}` (a plain SHA512 of the file bytes is rejected).
